"SAD TO
SEE YOU GO

Your pencil case PRO subscription has ended and the paid features are switched off. Your documents stay right where they are.

Changed your mind? Resubscribe any time and everything is back:

Get pencil case PRO https://pencilcase.app/upgrade"
`;

